<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>What shall I give Thee, Master?</l><l>Thou hast redeemed my soul;</l><l>My gift is small but it is my all—</l><l>Surrendered to Thy control.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>What shall I give Thee, Master?</l><l>Giver of gifts divine!</l><l>I will not hold time, talents or gold—</l><l>For everything shall be Thine.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
